      "side": 1,
      "message": "For `CONFIG_EC_HOST_CMD` the return here will send the response back to the host as it only allows a 1 to 1 request/response. We should be able to `disable_host_interface_interrupts` before we schedule the deferred reboot. So we don\u0027t need duplicate handling in `handle_pending_reboot`.",
