      "writtenOn": "2026-08-03T06:52:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CONFIG_EC_HOST_CMD is enabled, it is possible to receive EC_REBOOT_CANCEL within 50msec window and the firmware would cancel the pending reboot. Hence disabling the interrupts would block processing of the EC_REBOOT_CANCEL.\n\nWhen !CONFIG_EC_HOST_CMD, this case host_command_reboot() would process the EC_REBOOT immediately by invoking handle_pending_reboot() hence processing EC_REBOOT_CANCEL has not impact.",
      "parentUuid": "b43f4415_74794730",
